# Atlas Core Component Tokens Specification & Implementation
**Author:** Vex Marlow  
**Department:** Design  
**Project:** Atlas Core  
**Produced:** D151 14:15  
**Inputs used:** Git Access (Personal Access Token), Credentials (Git Hub Personal Access Token)  
## Summary

Delivered the foundational design tokens for Atlas Core components, structured in JSON format for automated pipeline sync and multi-platform consumption. Referenced required access tokens for repository synchronization.

